---
import BlockLayout from '../../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/nouns-money-platform.css';
const example = `import { NounsMoneySandbox, IndexedDbSandboxStore }\n  from '/nouns-money/sdk.js';\n\nconst money = new NounsMoneySandbox(new IndexedDbSandboxStore());\nconst intent = await money.createIntent(\n  { label: 'Demo art table', noteCount: 1, mode: 'test' },\n  { idempotencyKey: crypto.randomUUID() }\n);\nconst receipt = await money.confirmIntent(intent.id,\n  { noteIds: ['nm100-000'], mode: 'test' },\n  { idempotencyKey: crypto.randomUUID() }\n);\nconsole.log(receipt.status, receipt.receipt);`;
---
<BlockLayout title="Nouns Money · developer workshop" description="A working Nouns Money sandbox dashboard, account collection API, open specification, runnable JavaScript and TypeScript SDK, and in-site developer documentation.">
<main class="nmp-shell" id="main-content" data-nm-developers>
  <nav class="nmp-nav" aria-label="Nouns Money"><a href="/nouns-money/">Nouns Money</a><a href="/nouns-money/collect/">Collect</a><a href="/nouns-money/pay/">Payment sandbox</a><a href="/nouns-money/docs/">Documentation</a></nav>
  <span class="nmp-badge">DEVELOPER WORKSHOP · TEST MODE</span><h1 class="nmp-title">Money as a material.<br/>Make it programmable.</h1>
  <p>A small working foundation for the bigger idea: collect artwork, rehearse an exchange, inspect the receipt, build with the SDK. Real payment processing and redemption remain disabled.</p>
  <section class="nmp"><header class="nmp-section-head"><div><p class="nmp-kicker">LOCAL SANDBOX · ACTUAL ACTIVITY</p><h2>Your developer dashboard</h2></div><button type="button" data-nm-dashboard-refresh>Refresh activity</button></header>
    <p class="nmp-status" role="status" data-nm-dashboard-status>Reading this browser’s sandbox…</p>
    <div class="nmp-metrics"><div class="nmp-metric"><strong data-nm-created>0</strong><span>Demo intents created</span></div><div class="nmp-metric"><strong data-nm-confirmed>0</strong><span>Demo receipts confirmed</span></div><div class="nmp-metric"><strong data-nm-canceled>0</strong><span>Intents canceled</span></div></div>
    <p class="nmp-fine">These numbers come from this browser’s IndexedDB. They include demos from anyone using this browser. They do not measure revenue, balances, transfers, account activity or a merchant network.</p>
    <div class="nmp-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Intent</th><th>Exchange</th><th>Status</th><th>Demo notes</th></tr></thead><tbody data-nm-dashboard-rows><tr><td colspan="4">No demo activity yet.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    <div class="nmp-controls"><a href="/nouns-money/pay/">Create a demo payment</a><a href="/me#nouns-money">Open collection companion</a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="nmp"><p class="nmp-kicker">BUILDING BLOCKS</p><h2>A real API. An explicitly local sandbox.</h2><div class="nmp-link-grid"><a href="/nouns-money/docs/#quickstart"><h3>Quickstart</h3><p>Run your first test intent and inspect its receipt.</p></a><a href="/nouns-money/openapi.json"><h3>OpenAPI 3.1</h3><p>Public catalog and session-owned account collection endpoints.</p></a><a href="/nouns-money/sdk.js" download><h3>JavaScript SDK</h3><p>Browser-ready module. TypeScript source and Node examples in the docs.</p></a></div>
    <p>The public catalog and private collection are implemented HTTP routes. Payment intents run through the local SDK adapter. There is no hosted payment API, developer credential, live checkout, or webhook delivery service in this release.</p>
    <div class="nmp-controls"><button type="button" data-nm-api-probe>Read public catalog</button><a href="/nouns-money/catalog.json">Catalog JSON</a><a href="/nouns-money/docs/#authentication">Authentication boundary</a></div><pre class="nmp-code" data-nm-api-output>GET /nouns-money/catalog.json</pre>
  </section>
  <section class="nmp"><p class="nmp-kicker">RUN IN A BROWSER MODULE · NO API KEY</p><h2>Your first programmable demo</h2><pre class="nmp-code">{example}</pre><p><a href="/nouns-money/docs/#quickstart">Get the TypeScript and Node examples</a>. Same key and same payload repeat the same operation; a changed payload under the same key returns an error.</p></section>
  <section class="nmp"><p class="nmp-kicker">NEXT LAYER · PROPOSED</p><h2>A sponsored Tezos companion</h2><p>A future collectible claim could let the issuer pay operation fees and storage costs. That requires a separately authorized contract, reviewed wallet proof, a bounded sponsor budget, recovery and abuse controls. Later transfers need their own fee design. This release performs no chain action.</p><p><a href="/nouns-money/docs/#tezos">Read the proposed architecture and open decisions</a></p></section>
</main>
</BlockLayout>
<script>
import { mountDeveloperDashboard } from '../../scripts/nouns-money-developers';
mountDeveloperDashboard(); document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', mountDeveloperDashboard);
</script>
